<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end down ahead of refunding auctions.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end down ahead of refunding auctions.</headline>
<text>
<p>1520 GMT - Bonos end lower on Friday after a dull session of profit taking ahead of next week's Treasury refunding auctions</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 107.15 vs 107.33, yield 6.34 vs 6.32</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 116.78 vs 116.96 at Thursday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.51/53 vs 84.57/60</p>
